  <head>
    <meta name='title' content='mashtots-reveal-classic.x3d'/>
    <meta name='description' content='Slide 1 of the Mashtots deck as X3D: the 36 letters of Mesrop Mashtots alphabet leave the alphabet stone in the mural, cross the dark on cubic Bezier paths with comet trails, settle into one gilt line, rest, and return. Port of reveal.js (seed 405, stagger 0.075 s, flight 2.8 s, cubic ease). TimeSensor, PositionInterpolator, ScalarInterpolator and ROUTEs only; no Script.'/>
    <meta name='creator' content='port of the Mashtots deck JavaScript; X3D by Claude for the x3d.io project'/>
  </head>
